//RS /// The `wasmtime` crate version that backs sandboxed Component Model hosts
//RS /// (D-DEP-WASM1=A application `core.plugin`, and D-DX5-HOOK1=A compiler
//RS /// extensions). Application `core.plugin` still emits this pin into user
//RS /// bridge crates; the compiler-extension host links the same pin only in the
//RS /// sibling `jetpack` process under D-DEP1 / D-DX5-HOOK1. Reuses the already-
//RS /// approved Cranelift backend (D-JITDEP1). Pin matches `jet-jit`'s Cranelift
//RS /// generation instead of bloating the release with two backend generations.
//RS pub const WASMTIME_CRATE_SPEC: (&str, &str) = ("wasmtime", "25");
//RS /// The generated bridge uses the workspace's std-only foundation crate for
//RS /// descriptor-relative, no-follow plugin reads. Keep the path in the cache
//RS /// identity through the dependency map rather than duplicating its limits.
